<!DOCTYPE html>
<%# Social preview card, rendered to PNG by web/og/render.rb (not served) %>
<%#
The lock-up, set like a ruled manuscript leaf:
- The mark hangs in the margin like an initial. Its stem runs from the
  wordmark's cap height to its descender (59 + 19 px at 88 px). It is
  pressed like every sign (wedges), weighted so its heads match the
  wordmark's stems (~8 px).
- The baseline shares the wordmark's left edge, and both sit on ruled lines
  (the ruling is every 32 px, its lines at y = 31 + 32k): the name, then
  its baseline two rules down, the pair centred on the plate.
Baseline offsets (from the top of a line-height: 1 box) were measured in
Chromium for the self-hosted EB Garamond cuts.
%>
<% axis = 148; rule = ->(k) { 31 + (32 * k) } %>
<% lines = { name: rule.(9), monk: rule.(11) } %>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @font-face { font-family: "EB Garamond"; src: url("<%= fonts %>/eb-garamond-latin-400-italic.woff2"); font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; }
  @font-face { font-family: "EB Garamond"; src: url("<%= fonts %>/eb-garamond-latin-600-normal.woff2"); font-weight: 600; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
  html, body { width: <%= width %>px; height: <%= height %>px; overflow: hidden; }
  body {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #f3ede1;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 0 31px, rgb(160 132 92 / 0.09) 31px 32px);
    color: #2b241c;
    font-family: "EB Garamond", Georgia, serif;
  }
  /* Each line is placed by its baseline: top = baseline - offset */
  .line { position: absolute; left: <%= axis %>px; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap; }
  .name { font-size: 88px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.005em; top: <%= lines[:name] - 75 %>px; }
  .monk { font-size: 32px; font-style: italic; color: #62574a; top: <%= lines[:monk] - 27 %>px; }
  /* The mark: visual box from the cap line to the descender line */
  .mark { position: absolute; left: 76px; top: <%= lines[:name] - 58 %>px; height: 77px; width: auto; overflow: visible; }
  .mark g { fill: #a3301c; stroke: #a3301c; stroke-width: 6; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .plate { position: absolute; right: 76px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
           background: #fbf8f2; border: 1px solid #d9cdb6; border-radius: 4px; padding: 26px;
           box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(43 36 28 / 0.06), 0 22px 48px -18px rgb(43 36 28 / 0.28),
                       inset 0 0 0 6px #fbf8f2, inset 0 0 0 7px #d9cdb6; }
  .plate svg { display: block; height: <%= height - 120 - 52 %>px; width: auto; }
  .plate svg rect { fill: transparent; }
  .plate svg path { fill: #2b241c; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="mark" viewBox="-9 -9 118 168"><g><%= mark %></g></svg>
  <p class="line name">Cistergraphia</p>
  <p class="line monk">Your secrets, in a monk’s handwriting.</p>
  <div class="plate"><%= plate %></div>
</body>
</html>
